        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 294, Ornate Oval Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe delicate detailing of this Ornate Oval Knobset is perfect where ever a glamorous look is desired. When paired with the embellished rose, the Omnia 294/00 Ornate Oval Knob with Embellished Rose is dripping with an elegance that will surely add glamor to your home. Easy to install, it will fit 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" or 2\" door thicknesses with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Available in polished brass and shaded bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ornate Door Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 294 Ornate Oval Knob with Embellished Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lcn-4010-series-closer.jpg?v=1704354577\" width=\"177\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Oval Knobset",
                "description": "The delicate detailing of this Ornate Oval Knobset is perfect where ever a glamorous look is desired. When paired with the embellished rose, the Omnia 294/00 Ornate Oval Knob with Embellished Rose is dripping with an elegance that will surely add glamor to your home. Easy to install, it will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Available in polished brass and shaded bronze finishes.",
                "keywords": "Omnia 294/00 Door Knob Latchsets, OMN-294/00, ornate door knobs, Solid brass door knobs, ornate doorknobs, embellished knobsets, Omnia fancy door latchsets, Omnia 294 solid brass door knobs, Omnia embellished doorknob latchsets, omnia floral knobs, Oval Door Knobsets, Ornate Oval Knobsets, Oval knobs, omnia 260 Oval knobs, 294 omnia egg knobs,"
